# Normalize line endings on commit, check out native. Without this the repo is
# EOL-mixed (some sources are LF, some CRLF), and a CRLF checkout has already
# broken a validation gate once — commit e87512e, "runner:check must not fail on
# a CRLF checkout". This prevents that whole class rather than patching parsers.
* text=auto

# The authored runner rows are read by PapaParse and diffed against their JSON
# mirrors by runner:check / webpet:runner:check. Pin them to LF so a Windows
# checkout cannot introduce a phantom CSV-vs-JSON drift.
*.csv text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.ts   text eol=lf
*.js   text eol=lf
*.yml  text eol=lf
*.md   text eol=lf

# Shell scripts run inside Linux containers (docker/e2e/restore.sh) — CRLF here
# makes the shebang fail with a bare "not found".
*.sh text eol=lf

# Binary: never normalize, never diff.
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.pdf  binary
*.mp4  binary
*.bak  binary
*.docx binary
*.zip  binary
